@startuml Asset Registration Sequence
title Asset Registration Sequence

actor "Registration Staff" as Staff
participant "Registration App" as App
participant "Registration Desk Node\n(ESP32 Firmware)" as RegNode
participant "MQTT Broker" as MQTT
participant "Backend" as Backend
database "PostgreSQL Database" as DB
participant "WebSocket Manager" as WS

Staff -> App: Open Asset Registration page
App -> Backend: GET /assets
Backend -> DB: Load registered assets
DB --> Backend: Asset list
Backend --> App: Return asset list

Staff -> RegNode: Scan RFID tag
RegNode -> MQTT: Publish registration scan\n(tag_id, device_id)
MQTT -> Backend: Deliver scan message
Backend -> DB: Validate registration node
DB --> Backend: Node is valid
Backend -> WS: Broadcast latest_scan
WS -> App: Send scanned tag ID
App -> App: Fill tag ID field

Staff -> App: Enter asset name and assigned room
Staff -> App: Submit registration form
App -> Backend: POST /assets/register
Backend -> DB: Check tag is not active
DB --> Backend: Tag available
Backend -> DB: Create asset record\nflow_status = pending_placement
DB --> Backend: Commit success
Backend -> WS: Broadcast asset_registered
WS -> App: Send asset_registered
App -> App: Update asset table

@enduml